eneral case.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["enum AppError","Display and Error","Box<dyn Error>"],"captions":["A custom error is an enum: each variant describes a cause and may carry data, even another error","Display prints the error for people, the Error trait fits it into the ecosystem, From plugs it into the ? operator","Box<dyn Error> takes an error of any type: on the stack two pointers, to the data and to the method table"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["enum AppError {","    Empty,","    Parse(ParseIntError),","    Negative(i32),","}"],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":17.0,"w":270.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["impl fmt::Display for AppError {","    …","}","impl std::error::Error for AppError {}","impl From<ParseIntError> for AppError {…}"],"hl":[3,4],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":16.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":70.0,"y":60.0,"w":100.0,"h":26.0,"text":"ptr to data","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"v","x":70.0,"y":92.0,"w":100.0,"h":26.0,"text":"ptr to vtable","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"error on the heap","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t","x":270.0,"y":92.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"method table","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":120.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":120.0,"y1":92.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":92.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":138.0,"text":"Box<dyn Error>: 16 bytes on the stack","size":9.5,"mono":true}]],"cues":[13.9,28.8]}]},{"title":"Panic","sub":"Stack unwinding","short":"Panic","main":"panic unwinds the stack and calls drop; code 101; catch_unwind is a boundary.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["panic!","Stack unwinding","catch_unwind"],"captions":["panic!, a wrong index or unwrap on None interrupts the work: Rust starts unwinding the stack upward","On each frame drop runs for the values in it: files close, locks release; exit code is 101","catch_unwind can stop the unwinding: an isolation boundary, e.g. per request in a server, not error handling"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":120.0,"y":34.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"main","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":120.0,"y":62.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"load()  [Guard A]","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":120.0,"y":90.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"parse()  [Guard B]","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":120.0,"y":118.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"panic!(\"boom\")","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":120.0,"y":34.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"main","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"o":0.55},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":120.0,"y":62.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"load()  [Guard A]","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"o":0.55},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":120.0,"y":90.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"parse()  [Guard B]","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"o":0.55},{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":120.0,"y":118.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"panic!(\"boom\")","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"d1","x":300.0,"y":118.0,"text":"panic","tone":"red","size":9.0},{"t":"text","id":"d2","x":300.0,"y":90.0,"text":"drop B","tone":"yellow","size":9.0},{"t":"text","id":"d3","x":300.0,"y":62.0,"text":"drop A","tone":"yellow","size":9.0},{"t":"line","id":"up","x1":270.0,"y1":126.0,"x2":270.0,"y2":58.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":120.0,"y":34.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"main","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":120.0,"y":66.0,"w":200.0,"h":26.0,"text":"catch_unwind(|| …)","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"x","x":120.0,"y":100.0,"w":160.0,"h":22.0,"text":"…panic here…","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_si